# Google Ads conversion tracking. Optional — leave blank until the Ads
# account exists. Unset values are a no-op: no Ads config, no conversion
# events. Set these in Vercel (Production, Preview, and Development) and
# redeploy; NEXT_PUBLIC_* is baked into the browser bundle.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ADS_ID is the AW- account id (digits only after AW-).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ADS_LEAD_LABEL is the lead-form conversion label.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ADS_CALL_LABEL is optional; click-to-call conversions
# are skipped when it is blank. Labels are the tokens from Google Ads
# (letters, numbers, hyphen, underscore). Do not put contact details here.

NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ADS_ID=
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ADS_LEAD_LABEL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ADS_CALL_LABEL=
